welcome_email.body:
Dear {name},

Your new {role} account has been created on the TickTask Portal. Below are your login credentials:

• Portal Login URL: {portal_url}
• Username (Email): {email}
• Temporary Password: {password}
• Assigned Role: {role}
• Team Workspace: {team}

Note: Temporary passwords expire in 4 hours. You will be prompted to set your new permanent password upon your first login.

